  "text": {
    "markdown": "## Sprint board\n\n**8 tasks, 34 points.** 8 points are done (24%), 16 are in progress, 5 are waiting for review and 5 have not been started.\n\n| To do · 5 pts | In progress · 16 pts | Review · 5 pts | Done · 8 pts |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Add password reset (Maya, 3) | Checkout redesign (Priya, 8) | Search filters (Leo, 5) | Dark mode (Priya, 5) |\n| Write API docs (Tom, 2) | Fix login timeout (Maya, 3) | | Rate limiting (Leo, 3) |\n| | Upgrade Postgres (Tom, 5) | | |\n\n### By status\n\n**To do (2 tasks, 5 points)**\n- Add password reset — Maya, 3 pts\n- Write API docs — Tom, 2 pts\n\n**In progress (3 tasks, 16 points)**\n- Checkout redesign — Priya, 8 pts\n- Fix login timeout — Maya, 3 pts\n- Upgrade Postgres — Tom, 5 pts\n\n**Review (1 task, 5 points)**\n- Search filters — Leo, 5 pts\n\n**Done (2 tasks, 8 points)**\n- Dark mode — Priya, 5 pts\n- Rate limiting — Leo, 3 pts\n\n### By person\n\n| Person | Tasks | Points | Working on now |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | --- |\n| Priya | 2 | 13 | Checkout redesign |\n| Tom | 2 | 7 | Upgrade Postgres |\n| Maya | 2 | 6 | Fix login timeout |\n| Leo | 2 | 8 | Nothing in progress (Search filters is in review) |\n\n**Worth noticing:** almost half of the sprint's points (16 of 34) are in progress at once, and the 8-point Checkout redesign is the single largest item. Leo has nothing in progress and could pick up a to-do item or help with reviews.\n",
    "validation": {
